{"id":"n1-120","title":"Verb ずにはおかない (~zuni wa okanai)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses 'cannot help but...', 'will definitely...', or 'must do something'.","longExplanation":"The ずにはおかない grammar point conveys the sentiment of an inevitable action or a strong emotional compulsion. It can mean 'I can’t let it pass without doing X' or 'I definitely will do X'.","formation":"Verb-ない form (remove ない) + ずにはおかない","examples":[{"jp":"彼が困っていると聞いたら、助けずにはおかない。","romaji":"Kare ga komatte iru to kiitara, tasukezuni wa okanai.","en":"If I hear he is in trouble, I cannot help but assist him.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"困っ","vocabId":"1289590","reading":"こまる","baseForm":"困る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"聞い","vocabId":"1591110","reading":"きく","baseForm":"聞く"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"た"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"助け","vocabId":"1344390","reading":"たすけ","baseForm":"助ける"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"おか","vocabId":"1588920","reading":"おか","baseForm":"おく"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[10,11,12,13,14]},{"jp":"食事の準備がこのままだと、手伝わずにはおかないだろう。","romaji":"Shokuji no junbi ga kono mama da to, tetsudawazuni wa okanai darō.","en":"If the meal prep stays like this, I won't be able to stop myself from helping.","words":[{"surface":"食事","vocabId":"1358490","reading":"しょくじ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"準備","vocabId":"1341670","reading":"じゅんび"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まま","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"手伝わ","vocabId":"1328190","reading":"てつだう","baseForm":"手伝う"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":n